# November 18, 2026: Albany County outside Albany: Guilderland, Altamont, the hilltowns (Berne, Rensselaerville),
# Bethlehem, Coeymans, New Scotland and Colonie. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py (region albco), which offered
# Altamont. Mostly standing buildings: the county's ruins were already well covered (Huyck felt mill, Valley Paper Mill
