# National Register form for St. Paul's Lutheran Church at Berne (text layer read), the Town of Colonie, Pruyn House,
# Altamont Free Library, Town of Guilderland, Pomeroy Foundation, HMdb, Cobblestone Museum and Altamont Enterprise pages
# through tools/page.py, and the albanyhilltowns.com pages through the web fetch tool.
